DESCRIPTION:A LITTLE PRIDE\, A LITTLE PREJUDICE… AND A CHANCE TO TAKE TH
 E STAGE!\nAuditions are coming up for Elmira Little Theatre’s production
  of Pride and Prejudice\, directed by Craig Bond!\nBased on Jane Austen’
 s beloved novel\, Kate Hamill’s adaptation follows the outspoken Elizabe
 th Bennet as she navigates family expectations\, social pressures\, and th
 e frustratingly proud Mr. Darcy. Full of witty banter\, romantic misunders
 tandings\, and plenty of laughs\, this isn't your typical period drama!\nA
 UDITION DATES\nThursday\, November 12 | 5:00–8:30 PM\nSaturday\, Novembe
 r 14 | 10:00 AM–2:00 PM\nELT Building\n1000 Laurel Street\, Elmira\, NY
 \nAuditions will be cold readings\, so no preparation or sign-up is needed
 !\nWant to take a look at the script beforehand? Copies will be available 
 to read at the Steele Memorial and Corning Libraries.\nSHOW DATES: Februar
 y 12–14 & 19–21\, 2027\nWhether you're a seasoned performer or looking
  to try something new\, we'd love to see you at auditions!\n\nSource: FLXc
 alendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78508330/20261112170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78508330/20261112170000
END:VEVENT
