BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Happy Krampus: A wintertime Misadventure
DTSTART:20261114T010000Z
DTEND:20261114T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261113T170946Z
UID:78d8966a7b5dc368dadea8f00d878e59ddfed5eb@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Holidays
DESCRIPTION:Happy Krampus: A Wintertime Misadventure\nFri Nov 13th 6:00pm 
 - 7:00pm\nRose Hill Mansion\, 3373 New York 96A\, Geneva\, NY 14456\, USA
 \nHappy Krampus: A Wintertime Misadventure is a 60-minute immersive holida
 y theatrical experience presented by Historic Geneva and Breadcrumbs Produ
 ctions at Rose Hill Mansion. This holiday-themed production transforms the
  historic mansion in Geneva\, New York\, into the setting for a unexpected
  retelling of the famous European folklore figure in a playful\, mischievo
 us story. What is a Krampus?! According to legend\, this specific monster 
 would accompany St. Nicholas on his wintry walks and kidnap any naughty ch
 ildren\; the whispered horrors of what befell those Naughty Children kept 
 the other children in line. They must be good else they disappear\, on a c
 old dark night… like the Naughty Children did…\nThis theatrical re-tel
 ling suggests that there is more to explore in Krampus’ story. Perhaps t
 his Krampus is unlike the others. Perhaps nothing is what we thought.\nThr
 ough live performance\, dance-theater\, high-clown comedy\, and choose-you
 r-own-adventure storytelling\, audiences will explore Rose Hill Mansion as
  the world of the play unfolds around them\, making choices and encounteri
 ng characters throughout the space. Happy Krampus is designed for adults a
 nd adventurous families with children 12+. Guests under 16 must be accompa
 nied by an adult. (Naughty Children are not allowed!)\nJoin us at Rose Hil
 l Mansion for this new immersive holiday theater event and learn about the
  Krampus you’ve never known. The performance will take place throughout 
 the mansion’s first floor\, in the period-decorated rooms\, setting the 
 stage for this modern re-telling of a historical tale.\nRecommended for ag
 es 12 and up.\nThe hourlong performances are at 6 and 8 p.m with a recepti
 on from 7 to 7:45 p.m. Tickets are $27 each.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514571/20261113200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514571/20261113200000
END:VEVENT
