BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Windmill Farm & Craft Market\, Penn Yan
DTSTART:20261114T120000Z
DTEND:20261114T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20261113T170946Z
UID:9af25822130ba2a03b0bc747ee4f53c78773e3ec@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Food,Crafts,Family Fun,New to the Area,Music
DESCRIPTION:Located in the “heart of it all” and situated on 44 tree l
 ined acres for over 35 years\, The Windmill Farm & Craft Market is nestled
  in the rolling hills of Upstate New York. Just south of Penn Yan on State
  Route 14A and bordered by Keuka and Seneca Lakes\, the scenic surrounding
 s are almost unimaginable.\nThe Windmill is host to over 175 indoor and ou
 tdoor shops filled with hand crafted items too numerous to count. You will
  discover great food\, fresh produce\, flowers\, custom cabinetry\, furnit
 ure\, fashion\, local wineries\, artistry\, gifts\, micro brews\, entertai
 nment\, and so much more. The Windmill offers many onsite dining options f
 rom full restaurants to unending snack options. With six wineries\, a brew
 ery and a distillery\, The Windmill is a one stop destination for tastings
 .\nThe Windmill is a short drive from so many things to do and see\, it’
 s easy to see why they are in high demand for large and small group tours
 \, which are always welcome. We welcome limos\, small buses and large moto
 r coaches as well. There is ample\, convenient parking for several motor c
 oaches at the Hobson Road entrance. Reservations are not mandatory\, but T
 he Windmill would like to preregister groups so they can be welcomed with 
 a step on guide.\nBegin your day us at 8:00 a.m. and stay until we close a
 t 4:30 p.m. Admission is always Free!\nOpen every Saturday from the third 
 Saturday in April through the last Saturday in November\, plus Memorial Da
 y\, July 3rd & 4th\, Labor Day\, and Black Friday!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar 
 - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78366792/20260530080000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78366792/20260530080000
END:VEVENT
