DESCRIPTION:Event by West End Gallery\n12 W Market St\, Corning\, NY\nDura
 tion: 2 hr\nPublic\nJoin us on Opening Day! “Director's Choice” is a G
 roup Exhibit featuring a collection of artwork selected by the Gallery Dir
 ector.\nWe also have a special showcasing in the Upstairs Gallery\, A Trib
 ute to the Late Thomas S. Buechner.\nEnjoy IN PERSON: Meet the Artists\, v
 iew their creations\, enjoy live music\, and savor tasty treats while ming
 ling with fellow art lovers! The exhibit opens with a reception on Friday
 \, November 20th from 5-7pm. Music will be performed in the Upstairs Galle
 ry by Hugh Douglass on guitar and Richard Aerni on bass. Single-serve trea
 ts created by Old World Cafe. All events are free\, family-friendly\, and 
 open to the public. The "Director's Choice" exhibit in the Main Gallery on
  the first floor is wheelchair accessible. We hope to see you there!\nEnjo
 y ONLINE: www.WestEndGallery.net. Exhibit debuts online by 11am on Opening
  Day.\nExhibit on view November 20 – December 31\, 2026\nPREVIEWS and PR
 E-SALES:\nPre-sales ARE permitted before Opening Day. You may receive prev
 iews several ways:\n1. Follow us: Facebook\, Instagram\, LinkedIn and Alig
 nable\n2. Sign up for our general email announcements. https://www.westend
 gallery.net/newsletter-signup/\n3. Sign up for Exclusive Previews: Call th
 e Gallery to be added to our “Preview List” for the most comprehensive
  early access online 607-936-2011\n4. Visit the Gallery Opening Week: Mon 
 11/16 – Thurs 11/19 between 11:00am and 5:00pm\n5. Join us early on Open
 ing Day (11/20) before the reception starts. Doors open at 11:00am\nArtist
  credit for image graphic shown:\nTop Row: “CMoG in Wildflowers” water
 color & acrylic painting by Jennifer Fais\, “Gumballs in a Glass” oil 
 by Trish Coonrod\, “Morning Among the Lily Pads” oil by Anne Bialke\nB
 ottom Row: “Couch Donut - Hedgehog” oil by Emily Wolfson\,\n“Summer 
 Cows” oil by Ileen Kaplan\, “Green Paradise” bead embroidery cuff by
  San Fortune\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/ev
 ent/78515517/20261120170000
