DESCRIPTION:Event by Steuben Brewing Company\n10286 Judson Rd\, Pulteney\,
  NY\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nChris’s musical background includes duties 
 as lead singer and front man for rock and roll hall of famer and Grammy aw
 ard winner Levon Helm’s band\, The Barnburners. During the 6 years that 
 Chris and Levon played together they toured across the US and Canada light
