 ndary Rolling Stones sideman Bobby Keys\, The Fabulous Thunderbirds\, Jimm
 y Vivino\, Jeff Healy\, Dan Akroyd\, Albert Lee\, Dave Edmunds\, Dave Maxw
 ell and the great James Cotton to name just a few. Chris has also recorded
