DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Downtown Development\, Inc\nDowntown Elmira\nP
 ublic\n70th Annual Downtown Elmira Holiday Parade\nFriday\, November 27 
 • 10:00 AM • Downtown Elmira\nFREE Community Event\, Sponsored by Comm
 unity Bank\, N.A.\nKick off the holiday season in the heart of downtown El
 mira at the 70th Annual Downtown Elmira Holiday Parade! This beloved tradi
 tion brings together families\, local businesses\, performers\, and commun
 ity groups for a magical morning full of festive fun.\nWhat to Expect:\n
 • Festive Floats from local organizations\, businesses and emergency res
 ponse vehicles!\n• Marching Band & Local Performers bringing lively holi
 day music and entertainment\n• Special Appearance by Santa Claus and hun
 dreds of costumed characters spreading cheer to kids and families\n• Com
 munity Spirit Everywhere as neighbors line the streets to celebrate the se
 ason together\nParade Route:\nThe parade steps off from Water Street near 
 Elmira Tea & Coffee House and concludes at Wisner Park. Bundle up\, grab y
 our spot\, and enjoy the sights and sounds of the season!\nFor 70 years th
 e Elmira Holiday Parade has been a tradition that families have not only l
 oved to see\, but to participate in!\nCome to our costume fittings if you 
 are interested in being in the parade this year!\nVisit www.elmiradowntown
 .com for details\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzp
 j/event/78507661/20261127100000
