 he streets\, explore local shops\, enjoy great food and drinks\, and liste
 n to live music in the mini-park on the street. Discover something new aro
 und every corner!\nEach month\, downtown businesses feature something spec
 ial — from food and drink specials to discounts\, samples\, guest appear
 ances\, unique products\, and more. Some offers run all day\, others pop u
 p during business hours or into the evening — so the best plan is to com
 e downtown and see what you find!\nAlso look for these community events on
  First Fridays throughout the year:\nOctober—Fall Festival\nFebruary —
  Chilly Chili Cook-Off\nMarch — Wing Walk\nJune — Cruisin' Night\nBusi
 nesses: Please share your First Friday specials\, events\, or offerings in
  the discussion below!\nCome hungry\, come curious\, and make day of it in
  downtown Penn Yan!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0
 uzpj/event/78515401/20261204080000
