DESCRIPTION:Event by Steuben Brewing Company and Jad Tariq\n10286 Judson R
 d\, Pulteney\, NY\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nGet ready for an afternoon of w
 orld-class blues\, soul\, and rhythm & blues!\nMemphis-based Tony Holiday 
 is an acclaimed blues vocalist\, harmonica player\, and songwriter known f
 or blending Memphis soul\, Delta blues\, and traditional roots music.\nJoi
 ning him is Laura Chavez\, one of today's most celebrated blues guitarists
  and a 2023 Blues Music Award winner for Instrumentalist – Guitar. Known
  for her fiery\, expressive playing\, Laura has established herself as one
  of the premier guitarists in contemporary blues.\nRounding out the lineup
  is Jad Tariq\, a rising Memphis-based rhythm & blues guitarist and vocali
 st who recently joined Bob Dylan's touring band\, performing alongside the
  legendary songwriter during his 2026 summer tour. Jad brings a classic so
 und inspired by the swing\, blues\, and rhythm & blues of the 1940s and '5
 0s.\nThree exceptional musicians\, an incredible amount of talent\, and a 
 whole lot of blues. Don't miss this special performance at Steuben Brewing
  Company!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event
