  date\n---------------\nHe earned his stripes on Broadway… now the ghost
 -with-the-most is coming to Elmira.\nIt’s showtime! Based on Tim Burton
 ’s dearly beloved film\, this hilarious musical tells the story of Lydia
  Deetz\, a strange and unusual teenager whose whole life changes when she 
 meets a recently deceased couple and a demon with a thing for stripes. Wit
 h an irreverent book and a score that’s out of this Netherworld\, BEETLE
