SUMMARY:A Christmas Story
DTSTART:20261212T003000Z
DTEND:20261212T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261113T170946Z
UID:468837cfecbd3689d132fdc4ed2a0ef2740f9f53@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Holidays
DESCRIPTION:Humorist Jean Shepherd's memoir of growing up in the Midwest i
 n the 1940s follows 9-year-old Ralphie Parker in his quest to get a genuin
 e Red Ryder BB gun under the tree for Christmas. Ralphie pleads his case b
 efore his mother\, his teacher and even Santa Claus himself at Higbee's De
 partment Store. The consistent response: "You'll shoot your eye out!" All 
 the elements from the beloved motion picture are here\, including the fami
 ly's temperamental exploding furnace\; Scut Farkas\, the school bully\; th
 e boys' experiment with a wet tongue on a cold lamppost\; the Little Orpha
 n Annie decoder pin\; Ralphie's father winning a lamp shaped like a woman'
 s leg in a net stocking\; Ralphie's fantasy scenarios and more.\nA Christm
 as Story runs from December 4th-13th.\nFriday & Saturday performances star
 t at 7:30pm.\nSunday performances start at 2pm.\nTickets are on sale NOW!
 \n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514794
 /20261204193000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514794/20261204193000
END:VEVENT
